---
/** Category: a legend of three categories, each a dot in its hue beside its name, since color is never the only way a category is told. */
---

<span class="cover-sheet cover-stack" style="width:176px; padding:18px 18px 20px; --gap:14px">
  <span class="cover-line" style="--gap:10px"><i class="cover-dot cover-hue-1" style="--d:8px"></i><i class="cover-bar cover-bar-strong" style="width:72px"></i></span>
  <span class="cover-line" style="--gap:10px"><i class="cover-dot cover-hue-2" style="--d:8px"></i><i class="cover-bar cover-bar-strong" style="width:96px"></i></span>
  <span class="cover-line" style="--gap:10px"><i class="cover-dot cover-hue-3" style="--d:8px"></i><i class="cover-bar cover-bar-strong" style="width:56px"></i></span>
</span>
